    <string name="bulk_intro_text">Every recipient gets a separate SMS in their own conversation. It is sent in the background with a progress bar, pause and cancel, and messages that fail for a moment are sent again automatically.\n\nAndroid allows about 30 messages per minute by default, so Barq stays under that limit and never stops. To send faster, raise the limit in Settings → Sending limit.\n\nSending very fast to many people may make your carrier slow down or pause the SIM.</string>
