    <string name="limit_explain">Android sets this limit for every app. Above it, sending stops and Android asks for permission, so Barq stays under it. Raise it once and bulk sending becomes fast.</string>
    <string name="limit_raised_explain">The limit is raised, and bulk sending runs as fast as the modem allows. This setting is global and helps any other sending app too.</string>
